                        "source_sense_id": "223129fd-1d78-3e45-bc4a-c9ecae309465",
                        "source_sense_description": "een vloeistof die bedoeld is om een aangename geur te verspreiden",
                        "target_lang_word": "perfume",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "perfume",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72416554-1a1a-3095-a402-39291d3f9d6d",
                                        "entry_id": "1ed4ae26-b51b-35c5-8b8a-bc30d3422a87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pleasant smell; the scent, odor, or odoriferous particles emitted from a sweet-smelling substance; a pleasant odor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91c265ce-6360-4b9c-b15a-8b5aba38e05b",
                                                "sense_id": "72416554-1a1a-3095-a402-39291d3f9d6d",
                                                "text": "Breezes blowing from beds of iris quickened her breath with their perfume; she saw the tufted lilacs sway in the wind, and the streamers of mauve-tinted wistaria swinging, all a-glisten with golden bees; she saw a crimson cardinal winging through the foliage, and amorous tanagers flashing like scarlet flames athwart the pines."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f6ddc82-aa71-4483-93e5-ee22eea6aa25",
                                                "sense_id": "72416554-1a1a-3095-a402-39291d3f9d6d",
                                                "text": "Among the Turks, an exciting compound consists of olibanum, myrrh, camphor, musk, in pulverized form. The resultant perfume is said to affect the genitals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "04d14be6-a602-37bb-a83a-3cff549590c1",
                                        "entry_id": "1ed4ae26-b51b-35c5-8b8a-bc30d3422a87",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A substance created to provide a pleasant smell or one which emits an agreeable odor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7739ddb7-9436-406c-9e89-4a669f79d461",
                                                "sense_id": "04d14be6-a602-37bb-a83a-3cff549590c1",
                                                "text": "She bought a perfume at the airport."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e66f4839-5889-49b6-aaff-15bf840b7851",
                                                "sense_id": "04d14be6-a602-37bb-a83a-3cff549590c1",
                                                "text": "The market for prestige perfumes is pretty much restricted to what industry economists call “gotrocks ladies”—women in households with annual incomes over $40,000 and who are over forty but still young enough to have a sense of smell (Elizabeth Taylor, for instance)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eaf5910e-089e-4357-866a-ea40bc9c6b6f",
                                                "sense_id": "04d14be6-a602-37bb-a83a-3cff549590c1",
                                                "text": "The perfume industry is facing a major problem: maintaining constant levels of quality is crucial, but it is increasingly difficult to obtain a regular supply of all the necessary natural ingredients."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "perfume",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eab109dd-7f4d-3f51-9cb0-153e7c7c8c23",
                                        "entry_id": "95144905-e44c-3a2c-a4d5-b0e16d1f7f33",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To apply perfume to; to fill or impregnate with a perfume; to scent."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "89cc9a32-5857-4897-861e-e2eaefe8545a",
                        "source_entry_id": "fc6bcfa6-61dd-3cd5-9373-f70890eb3605",
                        "source_sense_id": "223129fd-1d78-3e45-bc4a-c9ecae309465",
                        "source_sense_description": "een vloeistof die bedoeld is om een aangename geur te verspreiden",
                        "target_lang_word": "eau de senteur",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "eau de senteur",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a3f2d49-c946-3348-98bc-866e9701e29a",
                                        "entry_id": "c5248d4d-8aba-3081-be20-ca47c4e51a1e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eau légèrement parfumée utilisée autrefois par les lingères pour imprégner le linge fraîchement repassé avant son rangement, et qui avait pour but d’apporter une impression de fraîcheur et de masquer les odeurs d’humidité qui pouvaient ressortir après séjour dans les armoires et les placards à certaines saisons."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a0c101a-c887-387e-8733-8eedd1e61aac",
                                        "entry_id": "c5248d4d-8aba-3081-be20-ca47c4e51a1e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eau parfumée pour le corps, ne contenant pas d’alcool, contrairement aux eaux de toilette."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25463412-6142-48bf-97ff-d8dc98f419cd",
                                                "sense_id": "8a0c101a-c887-387e-8733-8eedd1e61aac",
                                                "text": "« Si j’étais méchant, j’appellerais Desbacs au secours, il a dans son bureau toutes sortes d’eaux de senteur. »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b3bc29d-8d26-4ad8-9d83-834b125235f1",
                                                "sense_id": "8a0c101a-c887-387e-8733-8eedd1e61aac",
                                                "text": "Comme il faisait beau, elle avait fait la toilette des enfants. Ayant, le matin même, acheté pour eux avec son argent un petit flacon d’eau de senteur, elle en avait mis une bonne dose sur leurs cheveux ; et le petit, sur sa poitrine était comme un bouquet."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1923e4da-5623-44b8-b29e-ebf056780033",
                                                "sense_id": "8a0c101a-c887-387e-8733-8eedd1e61aac",
                                                "text": "Une eau de senteur sans alcool spécialement conçue pour les bébés de 0 à 2 ans."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
